  m_text: When there is an Orange tile on the same face of the cube that Shellington
    currently occupies, there is a random chance for a Dust Devil to appear. Once
    a Dust Devil appears, it will continue to move towards Shellington. If he is
    caught, Shellington will be thrown to another face of the cube.
